<title>USA: Spatialight names president, COO.</title>
<headline>Spatialight names president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>NOVATO, Calif 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spatialight Inc on Thursday said it promoted L. John Loomis to the posts of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Loomis previously served as senior vice president and chief operating officer, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>William Hollis, recently named as chairman of the board and chief executive, also served as president until Loomis' appointment. The chief operating officer position is new.</p>
<p>Spatialight supplies high-content information-display system components.</p>
</text>
